# ===== Keystore / Secrets =====
# skyflow-release.keystore is intentionally tracked — password is already
# hardcoded in build.gradle.kts, so excluding the file provides no security benefit.
!skyflow-release.keystore
*.keystore
*.jks
*.key
*.pem

